import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as s}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const c=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 208 | Four-Dimensional Assessment System Realm-Wide Implementation: Strength 40 / Mind 25 / Contribution 20 / Responsibility 15","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 208 | Four-Dimensional Assessment System Realm-Wide Implementation: Strength 40 / Mind 25 / Contribution 20 / Responsibility 15","no":208,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Four-Dimensional Assessment","Strength","Mind-State","Contribution","Responsibility"],"related":["17-Plane Transcendent Standards","29-Symbiosis Assessment System","180-General Realm Promotion Laws"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0208_模块1-四维考核制全境落地-力量40心性25贡献20责任15.md","filePath":"en/0208_模块1-四维考核制全境落地-力量40心性25贡献20责任15.md"}'),o={name:"en/0208_模块1-四维考核制全境落地-力量40心性25贡献20责任15.md"};function a(r,e,l,d,h,m){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[s('<h1 id="entry-208-four-dimensional-assessment-system-realm-wide-implementation-strength-40-mind-25-contribution-20-responsibility-15" tabindex="-1">Entry 208 | Four-Dimensional Assessment System Realm-Wide Implementation: Strength 40 / Mind 25 / Contribution 20 / Responsibility 15 <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-208-four-dimensional-assessment-system-realm-wide-implementation-strength-40-mind-25-contribution-20-responsibility-15" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 208 | Four-Dimensional Assessment System Realm-Wide Implementation: Strength 40 / Mind 25 / Contribution 20 / Responsibility 15&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 17, 29, 180</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-assessing-only-fists-cannot-test-guardians" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Assessing only fists cannot test guardians <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-assessing-only-fists-cannot-test-guardians" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Assessing only fists cannot test guardians&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The four-dimensional assessment system is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s core ruler for rating strong ones: strength 40%, mind-state 25%, contribution 20%, responsibility 15%. The meaning of this weight set is — it openly declares: <strong>strength is only the foundation, not the whole; no matter how hard one&#39;s fists, a mind-deficient person is not a Plane Transcendent.</strong> This entry explains how these four dimensions are implemented realm-wide, and why these weights.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the legal source of four-dimensional weights: the anti-predation axiom requires the mind-state dimension to rigidly veto predators; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the contribution dimension to recognize whole-network records not personal boasting; the collective ascension axiom directly corresponds to the responsibility dimension; the causal self-discipline axiom is embedded in mind-state and responsibility review; the law-first axiom requires weights to be stable, not temporarily adjusted for any strong one; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-four-dimensional-weight-table" tabindex="-1">I. Four-Dimensional Weight Table <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-four-dimensional-weight-table" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Four-Dimensional Weight Table&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Weight</th><th>Assessment Content</th><th>Nature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Strength</td><td>40%</td><td>Realm, energy, law manipulation</td><td>Baseline threshold</td></tr><tr><td>Mind-state</td><td>25%</td><td>Anti-predation stance, ethical坚守, mental maturity</td><td>Rigid veto item</td></tr><tr><td>Contribution</td><td>20%</td><td>Cultivation/knowledge/technology/service/ecology/guard contribution</td><td>Evidence item</td></tr><tr><td>Responsibility</td><td>15%</td><td>Willingness and ability to bear public responsibility</td><td>Commitment item</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Strength takes four-tenths, seemingly heaviest, but it is a &quot;passing line&quot; not a &quot;bonus item&quot; — without meeting strength, nothing else counts; while mind-state, contribution, and responsibility together take six-tenths, which is the key to picking out &quot;strong ones&quot; from &quot;thugs.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-these-weights" tabindex="-1">II. Why These Weights <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-these-weights" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why These Weights&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Strength 40%</strong>: without strength, guarding cannot be discussed, but strength itself is not worthy of worship.</li><li><strong>Mind-state 25%</strong>: a strong one with lost mind-state is civilization&#39;s greatest risk source; the weight must be high enough to be a veto item.</li><li><strong>Contribution 20%</strong>: contribution is &quot;what you have done for Myriad Races,&quot; only recognizing anchor-network empirical records.</li><li><strong>Responsibility 15%</strong>: responsibility is &quot;whether you are willing to continue doing it,&quot; corresponding to the annual 30% public-time obligation.</li></ul><p>This weight table itself is the collective ascension axiom quantified — six-tenths given to &quot;what you have done for others.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-realm-wide-implementation-path" tabindex="-1">III. Realm-Wide Implementation Path <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-realm-wide-implementation-path" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Realm-Wide Implementation Path&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The four-dimensional assessment is not a one-time big exam only used at Origin Realm, but a growth scale penetrating from low ranks:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Realm Segment</th><th>Strength Focus</th><th>Mind/Contribution/Responsibility Penetration</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sense–Condensed</td><td>Perception and basic energy</td><td>Community service (contribution sprout)</td></tr><tr><td>Transform–Law</td><td>Energy transformation and magical power</td><td>Guiding beginners, path compliance (responsibility sprout)</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Origin Realm</td><td>Personal Dao</td><td>Ethical deep scan (mind-state定型)</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Integration–Boundary-Breaking</td><td>Domain and cross-plane</td><td>Plane task records, karmic filing</td></tr><tr><td>Origin Realm</td><td>Cosmic-level power</td><td>Full four-dimensional assessment, no one dispensable</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Thus cultivators know from day one: just practicing fists can never make a true strong one.</p><h2 id="iv-rigid-veto" tabindex="-1">IV. Rigid Veto <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-rigid-veto" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Rigid Veto&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The mind-state dimension has &quot;one-vote veto&quot; power: anyone confirmed by ethical review to have predatory records or having chosen harm-others in extreme moral dilemmas, no matter how strong, is directly classified as a high-risk individual, with promotion and public posts frozen. This is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s &quot;red ink&quot; mark on the assessment form.</p><h2 id="v-four-dimensions-and-civilization-weight" tabindex="-1">V. Four Dimensions and Civilization Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-four-dimensions-and-civilization-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Four Dimensions and Civilization Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The four-dimensional assessment and &quot;civilization weight = individual combat power × civilizational consensus degree&quot; are mutually表里: strength determines combat power ceiling; mind-state/contribution/responsibility determine civilizational consensus degree. The more balanced the four dimensions, the higher the civilization weight — this is precisely the relationship Entry 213 will expand.</p><h2 id="vi-assessment-is-not-a-one-time-ticket" tabindex="-1">VI. Assessment Is Not a One-Time Ticket <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-assessment-is-not-a-one-time-ticket" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Assessment Is Not a One-Time Ticket&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The four-dimensional assessment is not tested once at Origin Realm and valid for life. It is dynamic re-evaluation: Plane Transcendents already recognized have their mind-state, contribution, and responsibility continuously tracked by the Alaya Network. If a strong one in old age becomes prideful over past merit and stops giving back, or slips in mind-state tests, re-evaluation issues warnings; for serious cases, permissions and post benefits are reduced per procedure, not &quot;one exam decided for life.&quot; This design plugs the old-system loophole of &quot;lying flat after reaching the peak,&quot; and makes the four-dimensional assessment a growth scale running through a strong one&#39;s whole life, not just an admission ticket.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: using four-dimensional scales to screen out lopsided &quot;only fighting&quot; types from the strong-one sequence, avoiding giving top-tier power to high-risk people</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: mind-state dimension one-vote vetoes predators, institutionally sealing off &quot;attaining Dao through killing&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style strong ones only compare strength and bloodline, mind-state endorsed by protagonist halo; in Heng Yuan Zhou mind-state takes 25% and can be vetoed</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: four-dimensional standards adapt to the five genealogies&#39; life forms, contribution metrics recognize each race&#39;s characteristic contributions</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: assessment outlines, ethical review procedures, and contribution measurement rules are all public</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-network-execution-of-four-dimensional-assessment" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Network Execution of Four-Dimensional Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-network-execution-of-four-dimensional-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Network Execution of Four-Dimensional Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The four-dimensional assessment system of strength 40, mind 25, contribution 20, responsibility 15 is entirely executed by the Alaya Network&#39;s automatic scoring system. Heng Yuan Zhou dares to quantify assessment because the network can collect objective data on three dimensions in real time: strength dimension&#39;s energy-level output, mind-state dimension&#39;s karmic self-discipline score, contribution dimension&#39;s civilizational increment records. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s assessment is not for elimination but for precise assistance — whichever dimension falls below threshold, the network automatically pushes corresponding training resources. The law-first axiom ensures assessment standards themselves are subject to charter review and cannot be arbitrarily modified. The universal equal infinite law ensures assessment uses the same ruler for all races.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The four-dimensional assessment system&#39;s essence is redefining &quot;what is a strong one&quot; as &quot;what is someone worthy of being entrusted with the cosmos.&quot; Strength is only the admission ticket; mind-state, contribution, and responsibility are the seats. This weight table is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s new definition of the words &quot;strong one.&quot;</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standards</a> · <a href="./29-共生度评估体系.html">29-Symbiosis Assessment System</a> · <a href="./180-境界晋升通用法则.html">180-General Realm Promotion Laws</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const g=t(o,[["render",a]]);export{c as __pageData,g as default};
